# An original waltz written for Inharmonia, on the minor descent
# (i–bVII–bVI–V) and a ii–V back to i.
title: Lanterns at Dusk
piece: lanterns-at-dusk
added: 2026-10-17
source: original
author: Inharmonia
key: A minor
meter: 3/4
tempo: 84
summary: An original minor waltz on the descending i–♭VII–♭VI–V, with a rolling left hand.
